#  ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  v3.2 BASE PRESERVED 1:1. Nothing existing was changed -- additions only.
#  v4.0 bridge instead of su · v4.1 tools/Root Lab/stack vector/terminal/+6 CVEs
#  v4.2 scanner fix (batch callback, error isolation, _fp_model)
#  v4.3 NAMES:
#    · the name is read from every key variant (name/deviceName/localName/…)
#    · the name is NO longer wiped on advertisement update (record merge)
#    · known names are pulled from bonded devices and bt_config.conf
#    · "Read name" button (GATT DIS 0x180A / Device Name 0x2A00)
#    · automatic name lookup when opening a device card
#    · "Names" filter
# ============================================================================
